              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero manuka, ujane abantu hamwe nababwira, umumarayika wanje azobaja imbere. Ariko igihe co kubahana nicagera, nzobahanira icaha cabo.”",
          "type": "text",
